      "verification": {
        "verified": false,
        "reason": "no_user",
        "payload": "tree e1bb8fdc1762950a39397df3f896add82e3c8e67\nparent db0bde16b910f43e37252d4172d97f01653ae0f1\nauthor MarcoFalke <*~=`'#}+{/-|&$^_@721217.xyz> 1791444950 +0200\ncommitter MarcoFalke <*~=`'#}+{/-|&$^_@721217.xyz> 1791444995 +0200\n\ntest: Set socket timeout in interface_http.py\n\nCurrently, the socket timeout in BitcoinHTTPConnection is not set, and\nsometimes reset (redundantly) to None.\n\nFix both issues by using the RPC timeout of the node, which should be\nlarge enough to cover all use-cases.\n\nSpecific tests can still call set_timeout() if they need to.\n",
