        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/trees/b1bd7431c03ee53101d27b28d00012f2e1d0e96f"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": false,
        "reason": "no_user",
        "payload": "tree b1bd7431c03ee53101d27b28d00012f2e1d0e96f\nparent fab1529ebc7c5618525afa2462135147974fc38e\nauthor MarcoFalke <*~=`'#}+{/-|&$^_@721217.xyz> 1791458252 +0200\ncommitter MarcoFalke <*~=`'#}+{/-|&$^_@721217.xyz> 1791458191 +0200\n\ntest: Rework 413 Too Large tests in interface_http.py\n\nThe tests had a few small problems:\n\n* The comment claimed that the send operation was blocking until\n  timeout. However, a send should terminate once the server closes the\n  socket.\n* The test possibly force-closed the connection, instead of testing the\n  outcome that the server closes it.\n* The test tried to read a \"413 Content too large\", but such an outcome\n  is not guaranteed when the server is closing the connection.\n\nFix all issues, by adjusting the comments and asserting the server\ncloses the connection.  The error code is only asserted in the debug\nlog.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgqxY/aMPiuXoCFn6iAEyAhvUqFX\njanTudd31Jtt35ct0AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQDEydp7lDuy6XiA1hdVfxlKkyrcnhA014nXiGyKKNmJMpurU9j8UcLODeX5o2GjfnU\nwM6GZtkzVew2YN4ryWtwk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----"
      },
      "parents": [
        {
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/commits/fab1529ebc7c5618525afa2462135147974fc38e",
          "sha": "fab1529ebc7c5618525afa2462135147974fc38e",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/commit/fab1529ebc7c5618525afa2462135147974fc38e"
        }
      ],
      "message": "test: Rework 413 Too Large tests in interface_http.py\n\nThe tests had a few small problems:\n\n* The comment claimed that the send operation was blocking until\n  timeout. However, a send should terminate once the server closes the\n  socket.\n* The test possibly force-closed the connection, instead of testing the\n  outcome that the server closes it.\n* The test tried to read a \"413 Content too large\", but such an outcome\n  is not guaranteed when the server is closing the connection.\n\nFix all issues, by adjusting the comments and asserting the server\ncloses the connection.  The error code is only asserted in the debug\nlog.",
      "committer": {
